; Letters' names. Cards pass through except a spelled word's letters (100 + code, the last 200 + code) and its end
; (-11). For a letter it asks the host for the letter's name (OUT at ask; eight cards come to INP at gn: the name's
; phoneme codes, then 0s), and sends each phoneme as 10 x code + stress: the first vowel other than AX (codes 3-17)
; gets 1 in the last letter's name and 2 in the others'. -1 goes between the letters; -20 in place of -11.
;
; Address Contents Label Opcode Operand Comment
  03            rec     INP   x        03-21: a card: pass it on, or a letter (last or not)
  04                    CLA   x
  05                    SUB   c101
  06                    TAC   pass
  07                    SUB   c99
  08                    TAC   nl
  09                    STO   y
  10                    CLA   00
  11                    STO   lst
  12                    JMP   ask
  13            nl      ADD   c100
  14                    STO   y
  15                    CLA   z
  16                    STO   lst
  17            ask     OUT   y
  18                    CLA   z
  19                    STO   done
  20                    CLA   n7
  21                    STO   i
  22            gn      INP   p        22-57: the name's phonemes, stressed
  23                    CLA   p
  24                    SUB   00
  25                    TAC   nx
  26                    CLA   p
  27                    SFT   10
  28                    STO   q
  29                    CLA   p
  30                    SUB   n3
  31                    TAC   put
  32                    CLA   p
  33                    SUB   c18
  34                    TAC   v
  35                    JMP   put
  36            v       CLA   done
  37                    SUB   00
  38                    TAC   st
  39                    JMP   put
  40            st      CLA   00
  41                    STO   done
  42                    CLA   q
  43                    ADD   n2
  44                    SUB   lst
  45                    STO   q
  46            put     OUT   q
  47            nx      CLA   i
  48                    SUB   00
  49                    STO   i
  50                    TAC   sep
  51                    JMP   gn
  52            sep     CLA   lst
  53                    SUB   00
  54                    TAC   dash
  55                    JMP   rec
  56            dash    OUT   m1
  57                    JMP   rec
  58            pass    CLA   x        58-84: -11 becomes -20; anything else as it is
  59                    ADD   c11
  60                    TAC   po
  61                    SUB   00
  62                    TAC   p20
  63            po      OUT   x
  64                    JMP   rec
  65            p20     OUT   m20
  66                    JMP   rec
  67            x       DATA  0
  68            y       DATA  0
  69            p       DATA  0
  70            q       DATA  0
  71            i       DATA  0
  72            done    DATA  0
  73            lst     DATA  0
  74            z       DATA  0
  75            n2      DATA  2
  76            n3      DATA  3
  77            n7      DATA  7
  78            c11     DATA  11
  79            c18     DATA  18
  80            c99     DATA  99
  81            c100    DATA  100
  82            c101    DATA  101
  83            m1      DATA  -1
  84            m20     DATA  -20
